00:09:05,454 --> 00:09:11,454
22 years inside a modern cult

2
00:18:10,909 --> 00:18:16,909
Holy Hell is a documentary film directed by Will Allen.

3
00:27:16,363 --> 00:27:22,363
An inside look at a West Hollywood cult formed by a charismatic
teacher in the 1980s that eventually imploded.

4
00:36:21,818 --> 00:36:27,818
Himself, played by Will Allen.

5
00:45:27,272 --> 00:45:33,272
Holy Hell is a 2016 American documentary film by Will Allen about his
experiences as a member of the Buddhafield cult for 22 years.

6
00:54:32,727 --> 00:54:38,727
The cult's leader, who has several names but is typically called
Michel, is claimed to have abused his followers.

7
01:03:38,181 --> 01:03:44,181
The film uses footage Allen shot during his capacity as the group's videographer and new
footage of interviews with former members and of the group in Hawaii.

8
01:12:43,636 --> 01:12:49,636
The film premiered on January 25, 2016 at the 2016 Sundance Film
Festival and saw a limited theatrical release in May 2016.

9
01:21:49,090 --> 01:21:55,090
It was picked up for broadcast by CNN and aired on September 1, 2016.

10
01:30:54,545 --> 01:31:00,545
It was selected for competition at the Sundance Film Festival.
